description:
DB migration needed before implementing the chat ID model change and senderMsgId.

SQL:
  ALTER TABLE chats ADD COLUMN contact_id TEXT;
  UPDATE chats SET contact_id = (SELECT peer_user_id FROM chat_members WHERE chat_id = chats.id LIMIT 1) WHERE kind = 'direct';
  CREATE UNIQUE INDEX chats_direct_contact ON chats(contact_id) WHERE kind = 'direct';
  ALTER TABLE messages ADD COLUMN sender_msg_id TEXT;
  UPDATE messages SET sender_msg_id = id;
  CREATE INDEX messages_sender_msg_id ON messages(chat_id, sender_msg_id);

The unique partial index on chats prevents duplicate direct chats with the same contact. The sender_msg_id index supports idempotent delivery lookup.

Applied via the existing migrate() function in kith-store/src/lib.rs by bumping PRAGMA user_version to 4.
